  "description": "Amendment agreed via email: Wed 12/08/2026 09:42. Works to tree with a TCA: Tree ID 8245     A Silver Birch tree approximately 10m in height, situated central on the end boundary of the rear garden.  The tree is in good form but has one low branch. Remove one low branch on the garden side, currently attached to the main stem at approximately 1.5 m. The branch should be pruned back to a suitable secondary union close to the main stem (leaving a target cut/branch collar intact). No further tree works approved.\rTree ID 8246     An English Oak tree approximately 12m in height, situated in the rear garden.  There was dead wood present throughout the crown and one branch a little low over the garden. To remove dead wood and one lowest branch growing towards the adjacent Bamboo. No other pruning required.\r",
